/* 城镇日常暗线 12 条 × 3 段 / 每条 Setup -> Complication -> Resolve / 不复制旧模板 */
:: MP Side Bookstall [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSideClues to ($mpSideClues or {})>>
高街的雨把旧书摊的帆布压出一道深槽，水顺着铁架往下滴，在石板上敲出细密的点子。你侧身挤到摊前，旧纸的霉味混着湿羊毛外套的气味一起涌上来。最上面压着一本深绿色旅行日记，塞拉守在摊后，铜镊子搁在账本边。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开旧书摊 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-side-bookstall">
<<investigateicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link "问塞拉日记的来历 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#side-act-mp-side-bookstall">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 260>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">><<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpSideClues["bookstall_map"] to 1>><span class="green">你用指尖顶住搭扣，轻轻一挑，锁舌弹开。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[沿着石阶往里探看 (0:04)|MP Side Bookstall Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">搭扣的铜边划开你的指腹，血珠渗进纸页。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[按住底座晃动再试 (0:04)|MP Side Bookstall]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[退回安全处 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">问塞拉日记的来历 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<link "耐着性子把车票按年份排开 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-side-bookstall">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 250 or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $mpSideClues["bookstall_map"] to 1>><<set $mpSideClues["bookstall_dates"] to 1>><span class="green">你顺着旧痕与字迹细细比对，从边角不起眼的折痕里理出了脉络。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[循着眉目往下追查 (0:04)|High Street]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">你翻找得太急，指腹被粗糙的边角磨得发烫，也没能立刻认出眉目。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[拂去表面浮尘再试 (0:04)|MP Side Bookstall]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先回入口歇息 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Side Bookstall Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSideClues to ($mpSideClues or {})>>
塞拉把怀表扣进绒布，往街尾抬了抬下巴。「上一个借它的人，穿灰大衣。每天四点二十来，站对面屋檐下，不买书。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先回高街避雨 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-side-bookstall-step2">
<<investigateicon>><<link "抄下日记里的路线 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#side-act-mp-side-bookstall-step2">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 280>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">><<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpSideClues["bookstall_man"] to 1>><span class="green">你贴着晾衣绳的阴影跟过去，听见他低声念了一个名字，又看见他左手缺了一截小指。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[把前因后果彻底理清 (0:04)|MP Side Bookstall Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">你踩进一处积水，水声在窄巷里格外响。灰大衣回头看了一眼，压低帽檐快步走开。</span><<stress 4>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[听准机括声响再试 (0:04)|MP Side Bookstall Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收起工具退回 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "跟到钟表铺门口 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-side-bookstall-step2">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpSideClues["bookstall_man"] to 1>><<set $mpSideClues["bookstall_tail"] to 1>>你找准受力支点稳稳使力，手头动作一气呵成。<span class="green">事情办得干净利落，没有留下半点疏漏。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[走过去印证来龙去脉 (0:04)|High Street]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你发力时脚下微滑，手腕偏了半寸没能吃上劲。<span class="red">虎口隐隐发麻，只得先收手缓一口气。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[找准借力支点再试 (0:04)|MP Side Bookstall Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转身离开此地 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Side Bookstall Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _first to true>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收好车票离开 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="res-mp-side-bookstall-resolve">
<<investigateicon>><<link "上前当面印证线索 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#res-mp-side-bookstall-resolve">>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("side_bookstall_payout")>><</if>>
<<set $mpSideClues to ($mpSideClues or {})>>
四点二十，灰大衣没有走向书摊。他穿过马路，在钟表铺的屋檐下停住，从口袋里摸出一张新票，夹进一本一模一样的深绿色日记里。你这才看清，他的左手缺了一截小指。
<br><br>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 420>>
	你叫住他，把那张旧票递过去。他看了很久，才说：「我父亲一直说，海雾线的末班车其实没有翻。」他从夹层里抽出一张手绘的支线图塞给你。<<if _first>><<money 800>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<set $mpSideClues["bookstall_branch"] to 1>><<stress -3>>
<<elseif ($history or 0) gte 240>>
	你叫住他，把旧票还了回去。他点点头，没有多说，只把日记留给你，说：「替我放回箱子里。」<<if _first>><<money 300>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<stress -1>>
<<else>>
	你犹豫了一下，灰大衣已经走远。旧货商从对街凑过来，翻了翻你手里的日记，只肯出几个铜板。<<stress 4>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
	<br>
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[把日记放回木箱 (0:03)|MP Side Bookstall]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
	<br>
	<br>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[把支线图交给塞拉 (0:04)|High Street]]>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Sera")>><<mpnpcincr Sera trust 1>><</if>><<pass 4>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">把支线图交给塞拉 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<br>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺集市看早集果蔬摊 (0:04)|MP Moment Market 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Side Cafe Alley [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSideClues to ($mpSideClues or {})>>
咖啡馆后巷的垃圾桶刚被拖走，地上留着一圈深色的水印。烘焙过的豆香从排风扇里一阵阵压下来，混着巷子尽头鱼摊的腥气。垃圾桶旁的矮墙上放着一只没洗的咖啡杯，格威岚站在后门口，一直看着它。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回到咖啡馆前门 (0:02)|Cliff Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-side-cafe-alley">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "凑近问格威岚在等谁 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#side-act-mp-side-cafe-alley">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 300>>
	<span class="green">你走过去，没有碰那只杯子。格威岚的肩膀绷了一下，随即放松。「你也觉得奇怪，是吧。」</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[迈步前往下一处地点 (0:04)|MP Side Cafe Alley Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">你刚开口，格威岚就转身进了厨房，纱帘晃了两下。</span><<stress 3>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[稳住气息重新上手 (0:04)|MP Side Cafe Alley]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回原处 (0:03)|Cliff Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "躲到垃圾桶后观察 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-side-cafe-alley">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $mpSideClues["cafe_watch"] to 1>>你顺着器物纹理巧施寸劲，原本卡滞的关窍应声松开。<span class="green">你将内里藏着的收获稳稳纳入怀中。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[循着眉目往下追查 (0:04)|Cliff Street]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	冷不防一阵穿堂风吹来，迷了眼角也打乱了手头节奏。<span class="red">指尖在边缘滑脱，你只好先退开半步。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[换个角度再次尝试 (0:04)|MP Side Cafe Alley]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂且收手离开 (0:03)|Cliff Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Side Cafe Alley Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSideClues to ($mpSideClues or {})>>
四点二十，巷口没有出现任何人。格威岚把杯子端回厨房，又换了一只新的，重新倒满，放回原处。碟子底下压着一张折了两折的纸，刚才还没有。纸角被咖啡浸湿，晕出一小片褐色。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[从后巷离开 (0:02)|Cliff Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-side-cafe-alley-step2">
<<investigateicon>><<link "去查纸上写的地址 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-side-cafe-alley-step2">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 270>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">><<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpSideClues["cafe_note"] to 1>><span class="green">你趁格威岚转身，把纸抽出来翻到背面。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[把前因后果彻底理清 (0:04)|MP Side Cafe Alley Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">你的手肘碰倒了靠在墙边的托盘，铁盘砸在地上，声音在巷子里炸开。</span><<stress 4>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦干手心汗水再试 (0:04)|MP Side Cafe Alley Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[退回安全处 (0:03)|Cliff Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "把纸还给格威岚 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#side-act-mp-side-cafe-alley-step2">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 250 or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $mpSideClues["cafe_note"] to 1>>你听准后巷的脚步声，趁空档把堆叠的咖啡豆袋挪回檐下。<span class="green">豆袋遮好了雨，后巷恢复整洁。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺藤摸瓜上前查证 (0:04)|Cliff Street]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	内里的阻力比看上去沉得多，你试着扳动时震落了一层浮灰。<span class="red">为防弄出太大声响，你先行撤手暂退。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[看准卡槽位置再试 (0:04)|MP Side Cafe Alley Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先回入口歇息 (0:03)|Cliff Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Side Cafe Alley Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _first to true>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回到咖啡馆前门 (0:02)|Cliff Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="res-mp-side-cafe-alley-resolve">
<<investigateicon>><<link "上前当面印证线索 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#res-mp-side-cafe-alley-resolve">>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("side_cafe_alley_payout")>><</if>>
<<set $mpSideClues to ($mpSideClues or {})>>
五点，格威岚开始收拾。他把杯子一只只擦干，放回架上，唯独留下台阶上那只。你问他，他沉默了很久，才说那个人以前每天四点二十来，点小杯不加糖，坐在靠窗的位置改稿。
<br><br>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	你陪他把那只杯子端回厨房，没有追问。<<if _first>><<money 500>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<stress -4>>
<<elseif ($willpower or 0) gte 240>>
	你告诉他，纸上的字母也许不是名字，是咖啡馆的旧桌号。<<if _first>><<money 200>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<stress -1>>
<<else>>
	你把纸放在柜台上就走了。<<stress 3>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
	<br>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[帮格威岚擦干杯子 (0:04)|Cliff Street]]>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>><<npcincr Gwylan love 1>><</if>><<pass 4>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
	<br>
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[再看一眼后巷台阶 (0:03)|MP Side Cafe Alley]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Side Orphan Laundry [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSideClues to ($mpSideClues or {})>>
孤儿院洗衣房的门一推开，热蒸汽就糊住了你的睫毛。碱水和湿棉布的味道堵在喉咙里，像含了一口肥皂。三台滚筒洗衣机同时转着，铁皮外壳震得墙上的挂钩叮当响。洗衣筐最上面搭着一件男士衬衫，领口绣着贝利的缩写。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退出洗衣房 (0:02)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-side-orphan-laundry">
<<investigateicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Bailey")>><<link "问贝利衬衫的来历 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#side-act-mp-side-orphan-laundry">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 250>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">><<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpSideClues["laundry_slip"] to 1>><span class="green">你翻到洗衣筐后面的硬纸板，抽出一张受潮的收衣单。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[沿着石阶往里探看 (0:04)|MP Side Orphan Laundry Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">你弯腰时碰翻了碱水桶，灰白的液体泼在鞋面和裤脚上，皮肤很快泛起刺痛。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 3>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[凑近微光看清再试 (0:04)|MP Side Orphan Laundry]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂退一步歇脚 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">问贝利衬衫的来历 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<link "翻查储物柜下层 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-side-orphan-laundry">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $mpSideClues["laundry_slip"] to 1>><<set $mpSideClues["laundry_box"] to 1>><span class="green">你稳住呼吸沉住气观察片刻，在不起眼的夹缝间看清了端倪。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[循着眉目往下追查 (0:04)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">冷风吹得你肩头微僵，稍一分神便错过了最佳时机。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺着纹理方向再试 (0:04)|MP Side Orphan Laundry]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺原路退回 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Side Orphan Laundry Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSideClues to ($mpSideClues or {})>>
你把收衣单摊在熨衣板上。最下面一行写着码头旧衣铺的地址，旁边盖着一枚褪色的圆章。贝利看了一眼，没有伸手去拿。「雷恩以前住二楼最里面那间。」她说，「后来从洗衣房后窗爬出去，再没回来。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开洗衣房 (0:02)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-side-orphan-laundry-step2">
<<investigateicon>><<link "拆开最上面的信 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#side-act-mp-side-orphan-laundry-step2">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 280>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">><<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpSideClues["laundry_letters"] to 1>><span class="green">你用发卡挑开簧片，盒盖弹起一条缝。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[把前因后果彻底理清 (0:04)|MP Side Orphan Laundry Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">簧片突然回弹，夹住你的指节，疼得你倒吸一口气。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[活动酸麻手指再试 (0:04)|MP Side Orphan Laundry Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回原处 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
