:: MP Side Orphan Laundry Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _first to true>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回到孤儿院走廊 (0:02)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="res-mp-side-orphan-laundry-resolve">
<<investigateicon>><<link "上前当面印证线索 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#res-mp-side-orphan-laundry-resolve">>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("side_orphan_laundry_payout")>><</if>>
<<set $mpSideClues to ($mpSideClues or {})>>
信纸很薄，边缘有反复摩挲的毛边。最早的一封写着：「衬衫我洗好了，你回来拿。」没有地址，也没有落款。后面的信越来越短，最后一封只有一行：「码头风大，记得穿外套。」
<br><br>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 420>>
	你把信按日期排好，发现每封信的邮戳都来自同一个码头仓库。<<if _first>><<money 400>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<trauma -1>><<set $mpSideClues["laundry_wharf"] to 1>><<stress -3>>
<<elseif ($english or 0) gte 240>>
	你只认出最近一封信上的仓库编号。<<if _first>><<money 200>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<trauma -1>><<stress -1>>
<<else>>
	你把信放回盒子，没能理出地址。贝利没有说什么，只把盒子重新锁好，放回柜底。<<stress 3>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
	<br>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Bailey")>><<link [[帮贝利把衬衫晾起来 (0:04)|Orphanage]]>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Bailey")>><<npcincr Bailey love 1>><</if>><<pass 4>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">帮贝利把衬衫晾起来 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<br>
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[再看一眼那件衬衫 (0:03)|MP Side Orphan Laundry]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Side School Goggles [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSideClues to ($mpSideClues or {})>>
<<if Time.hour gte 15 or Time.dayState is "dusk">>放学后的更衣室空得能听见水滴。<<else>>课间安静的更衣室空得能听见水滴。<</if>>氯气味从泳池那边渗过来，混着湿毛巾和橡胶拖鞋的酸味。失物招领箱搁在长凳尽头，箱盖半开，里面堆着单只手套、断带凉鞋和一团缠死的泳帽。箱底压着一副泳镜，镜腿内侧用记号笔写着一串数字。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回到学校走廊 (0:02)|Hallways]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-side-school-goggles">
