<<if ($science or 0) gte 320 or ($maths or 0) gte 320>>
	<<set $mpSideClues["goggles_coord"] to 1>><span class="green">你借了梅森桌上的地图册，把坐标按比例换算。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
