<<else>>
	<span class="red">你盯着那串数字看了太久，眼睛发酸，只记住了一个模糊的方向。</span><<tiredness 2>><<stress 3>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[听准机括声响再试 (0:04)|MP Side School Goggles]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收起工具退回 (0:03)|Hallways]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">问梅森那个学生的事 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<link "摸到更衣室后墙 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-side-school-goggles">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $mpSideClues["goggles_coord"] to 1>><<set $mpSideClues["goggles_door"] to 1>>你先稳住下盘重心，再分寸不差地完成了最后一步。<span class="green">阻碍迎刃而解，手头收获已贴身收好。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[循着眉目往下追查 (0:04)|Hallways]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	器物边角沾着湿滑的潮气，你捏紧使劲时还是滑脱了一下。<span class="red">掌心擦出一道红印，眼下未能得手。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[找准借力支点再试 (0:04)|MP Side School Goggles]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转身离开此地 (0:03)|Hallways]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

