<<investigateicon>><<link "上前当面印证线索 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#res-mp-side-temple-coin-resolve">>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("side_temple_coin_payout")>><</if>>
<<set $mpSideClues to ($mpSideClues or {})>>
墓园尽头有一座没有名字的小碑，碑前摆着七枚同年的硬币。穿连帽外套的人蹲在碑前，听见脚步也没有回头。「那年火里，我欠了七个人。」他说，「每周还一枚，还完就走。」他的声音很哑，像被烟熏过。
<br><br>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	你蹲下，把最后一枚硬币放在碑顶。<<if _first>><<money 600>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<trauma -1>><<set $mpSideClues["temple_photo"] to 1>><<stress -3>>
<<elseif ($willpower or 0) gte 240>>
	你把硬币放回碑前，没有多问。那人起身走了，连帽外套的背面沾着草屑。<<if _first>><<money 300>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<stress -1>>
<<else>>
	你伸手去拿硬币，那人猛地站起来，撞开你的肩膀。<<pain 2>><<stress 4>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
	<br>
	<br>
	<<templeicon>><<link [[把硬币交还捐赠箱 (0:04)|Temple]]>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<npcincr Jordan love 1>><</if>><<pass 4>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
	<br>
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[再看一眼无字碑 (0:03)|MP Side Temple Coin]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>>
