<<socialiseicon>><<link "推门进去和凯拉说话 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#side-act-mp-side-window-mannequin-step2">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 290>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">><<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpSideClues["window_pin"] to 1>><span class="green">你贴着墙根挪到侧门边，没有碰到门口的感应灯。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[把前因后果彻底理清 (0:04)|MP Side Window Mannequin Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">你后退时踢到了靠在墙边的广告牌，塑料板倒在地上，声音在空街上格外响。</span><<stress 4>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[活动酸麻手指再试 (0:04)|MP Side Window Mannequin Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回原处 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "低声先在门外看那只胸针 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#side-act-mp-side-window-mannequin-step2">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $mpSideClues["window_pin"] to 1>><<set $mpSideClues["window_brooch"] to 1>>你定下心神循序渐进，将每一处细节都照顾得周全妥帖。<span class="green">在场之人无不对你的利落手法心服口服。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[走过去印证来龙去脉 (0:04)|High Street]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	里层的机括环环相扣，你拨开第一道却被第二道顶了回来。<span class="red">震手之余毫无寸进，还得换个路数再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[避开湿滑边角再试 (0:04)|MP Side Window Mannequin Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂且收手离开 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Side Window Mannequin Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _first to true>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[沿商业街离开 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="res-mp-side-window-mannequin-resolve">
<<investigateicon>><<link "上前当面印证线索 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#res-mp-side-window-mannequin-resolve">>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("side_window_mannequin_payout")>><</if>>
<<set $mpSideClues to ($mpSideClues or {})>>
凯拉没有跑。她抱着布袋，说橱窗里的模特是她母亲以前用过的，母亲在商业街做了二十年裁缝，后来店没了，模特被卖到这里。「我只是想让它穿得好看一点。」
<br><br>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420 or ($english or 0) gte 420>>
	你帮她把围巾重新系好，又调整了模特的手腕。凯拉退后两步，看了很久，笑了一下。<<if _first>><<money 600>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<set $mpSideClues["window_kept"] to 1>><<stress -3>>
<<elseif ($willpower or 0) gte 240 or ($english or 0) gte 240>>
	你陪她站了一会儿。凯拉把东西一件件收回布袋，只留下那条围巾。<<if _first>><<money 200>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<stress -1>>
<<else>>
	你刚开口，凯拉就把布袋抱紧，转身从侧门跑了。模特歪在橱窗里，一只手套掉在地上。<<stress 4>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
	<br>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[把围巾留给凯拉 (0:04)|High Street]]>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Kylar")>><<npcincr Kylar love 1>><</if>><<pass 4>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
	<br>
	<br>
	<<link [[再看一眼橱窗模特 (0:03)|MP Side Window Mannequin]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Side Clock Chalk [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSideClues to ($mpSideClues or {})>>
旧钟塔的基座被围栏挡着，石阶上长满青苔。塔身下方的墙面上，有人用粉笔写了一串数字：17。数字很大，笔画粗，末端被雨水冲淡。昨天你路过时，写的是 18。悉尼抱着一卷旧年表从钟塔侧门出来。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[沿高街离开 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-side-clock-chalk">
<<investigateicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Sydney")>><<link "和悉尼翻旧钟塔年表 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-side-clock-chalk">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 320 or ($history or 0) gte 320>>
	<<set $mpSideClues["chalk_date"] to 1>><span class="green">你按日期往回推算，发现倒计时归零那天正好是钟塔落成纪念日。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[迈步前往下一处地点 (0:04)|MP Side Clock Chalk Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">你算错了日期，把纪念日提前了两天。</span><<stress 3>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[听准机括声响再试 (0:04)|MP Side Clock Chalk]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收起工具退回 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">和悉尼翻旧钟塔年表 (0:06)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<link "低声夜里绕到钟塔围栏后 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-side-clock-chalk">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpSideClues["chalk_date"] to 1>><<set $mpSideClues["chalk_watch"] to 1>>你敏锐地捕捉到一丝松动，顺势一提便将事情圆满办妥。<span class="green">苦心查探的眉目终于水落石出。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[循着眉目往下追查 (0:04)|High Street]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	旁边阴影里忽然掠过一点动静，让你不得不分神戒备。<span class="red">一念之差错失良机，只能先退后观望。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[找准借力支点再试 (0:04)|MP Side Clock Chalk]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转身离开此地 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Side Clock Chalk Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSideClues to ($mpSideClues or {})>>
你们算出的日期是下周三，钟塔落成纪念日。悉尼翻到书的最后一页，上面印着旧钟塔的剖面图，塔基下有一条检修通道，入口在排水沟旁。图上的线条很细，有几处被铅笔重新描过。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回高街 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-side-clock-chalk-step2">
<<investigateicon>><<link "进值班室看那本日历 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#side-act-mp-side-clock-chalk-step2">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">><<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpSideClues["chalk_room"] to 1>><span class="green">你用发卡拨开旧锁，铁门无声向内滑开。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[把前因后果彻底理清 (0:04)|MP Side Clock Chalk Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">锁簧卡住，发卡断在锁孔里。你用力转了一下，铁门发出刺耳的响声。</span><<stress 4>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[收敛呼吸节奏再试 (0:04)|MP Side Clock Chalk Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂退一步歇脚 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Sydney")>><<link "低声和悉尼在门外等午夜 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-side-clock-chalk-step2">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $mpSideClues["chalk_room"] to 1>>你避开正面的滞涩处，从侧面暗槽轻轻一挑便见了分晓。<span class="green">暗藏的器物与线索尽数归入你手。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺藤摸瓜上前查证 (0:04)|High Street]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	粗砺的边缘刮得指肚生疼，你下意识缩手避开了锋芒。<span class="red">刚才这一下未能奏效，还得重新找准切入点。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[挽起袖口稳稳再试 (0:04)|MP Side Clock Chalk Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺原路退回 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">低声和悉尼在门外等午夜 (0:06)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Side Clock Chalk Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _first to true>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[沿高街离开 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="res-mp-side-clock-chalk-resolve">
<<investigateicon>><<link "上前当面印证线索 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#res-mp-side-clock-chalk-resolve">>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("side_clock_chalk_payout")>><</if>>
<<set $mpSideClues to ($mpSideClues or {})>>
门后是一间很小的守钟人值班室。桌上摆着一截粉笔、一本日历和一只上锁的木匣。日历上的日期依旧被逐条划掉，最后一天圈着。木匣的锁很旧，匣盖上刻着一行小字：「给记得的人。」
<br><br>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 430 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 430>>
	你按年表上的旧锁制式打开木匣。里面是一枚铜钟锤、一本手写的守钟日志和几张旧照片。<<if _first>><<money 900>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<set $mpSideClues["chalk_box"] to 1>><<stress -3>>
<<elseif ($history or 0) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260>>
	你打开木匣，里面只有一枚旧钟锤和半截粉笔。<<if _first>><<money 400>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<stress -1>>
<<else>>
	你用力过猛，木匣的锁扣崩开，匣盖裂了一道缝。里面空空的，只有一层粉笔灰。<<stress 4>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
	<br>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Sydney")>><<link [[和悉尼把钟锤带回学校 (0:05)|High Street]]>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Sydney")>><<npcincr Sydney love 1>><</if>><<pass 5>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">和悉尼把钟锤带回学校 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<br>
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[再看一眼粉笔数字 (0:03)|MP Side Clock Chalk]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
